%!PS-Adobe-3.0
%%Title: Ricoh SP 210 Mac test page
%%Pages: 1
%%EndComments
%%Page: 1 1
/Helvetica-Bold findfont 28 scalefont setfont
72 760 moveto (Ricoh SP 210SU on macOS) show
/Helvetica findfont 14 scalefont setfont
72 730 moveto (If you can read this, the Mac driver works.) show
% border 1 inch in from each edge of A4
2 setlinewidth 36 36 523 770 rectstroke
% grey ramp: tests halftoning
0 1 9 { /i exch def i 10 div setgray 72 i 45 mul add 600 40 40 rectfill } for
% thin lines: tests resolution
0 setgray 0.25 setlinewidth
0 1 40 { 4 mul 72 add dup 400 moveto 560 lineto stroke } for
/Courier findfont 10 scalefont setfont
72 360 moveto (0.25pt lines above, grey ramp 0-90% above that.) show
showpage
%%EOF
